    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evolved block-breaking game controlled with a mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use technique and strategy to advance through three levels and over 100 stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the stage, the blocks will scroll and rotate dynamically, or stack in multiple layers, showing a variety of different movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you destroy a certain number of blocks, four types of items will appear randomly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtaining and using these items will give you an advantage as you progress through the stages.</p>",
